----- stdout -----
bare-path — a backticked file-shaped path in markdown prose exists
code-doc-ref — a doc path cited inside a non-markdown source file exists
file-length — flag files that exceed their per-glob size budget (lines or tokens)
import-target — an `@path` import in a guidance file resolves on disk
link-case — a link target's case matches the filesystem exactly
link-target — a relative markdown link or image target exists on disk

